00:09:51,990 --> 00:09:55,110
There are the jury standards and de facto standards to families.

98
00:09:55,110 --> 00:09:59,110
The jury standards are the ones that are imposed by some kind of regulation.

99
00:09:59,110 --> 00:10:03,829
So it's usually a standard you see imposed by governments for example.

100
00:10:03,829 --> 00:10:12,870
So when you look at your electric plug at home, there's some regulation there that says this plug needs to have these properties and that's a standard that gets imposed.

101
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:15,110
It's a danger jury standard.

102
00:10:15,110 --> 00:10:22,630
And then there are de facto standards which are really uh specifications that are out there

103
00:10:22,630 --> 00:10:30,870
and people agree to use it to implement it and by virtue of being used and implemented and used by everyone they become standards.

104
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:33,750
